WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.289
Precision starts with your part.

00:00:02.589 --> 00:00:06.021
Explore C&B Machinery's
approach to face grinding.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.991
See the complete system,

00:00:08.991 --> 00:00:12.583
then look closer at robotic
handling and the grinding process.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.347
For this ring gear, the conversation
begins with two opposing faces.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:26.046
Double-disc grinding removes
material from opposing part surfaces.

00:00:26.346 --> 00:00:30.959
Geometry, material and finished-part
requirements shape the application.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.180
Start with the application you know.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.600
You don't have to select a machine first.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.410
Share the details you have.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:39.899
Leave open questions for discussion.

00:00:40.199 --> 00:00:42.670
Review your brief, then send your inquiry.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.651
Keep the same requirements together as
the conversation moves to a proposal.

00:00:47.951 --> 00:00:51.208
Review the scope, discuss it,
or request a revision.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.694
Let's start with your part.

00:00:54.994 --> 00:00:57.346
Request a quote from C&B Machinery.
